args: opentide --json share status --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Compare the local ledger with object versions. Does not contact the destination.

Usage: opentide share status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --target <TARGET>
          Destination block name. Repeatable.

      --uuid <UUID>
          Limit to these object UUIDs.

      --type <OBJECT_TYPE>
          Limit to threat, objective, or rule.

      --file <FILE>
          Limit to these object files.

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide share status

━━━ stderr · empty
